 "response": {
  "text": "For **men in India under ₹2000**, the safest brand pick is **Wrangler** if you want a reliable all-rounder, followed by **Levi’s** only if you find a sale price under your budget.[3][9][20]\n\nIf you want the best options by need, I’d rank them like this:\n\n- **Wrangler** — best overall for durability and everyday wear; it has jeans listed under ₹2000 and is repeatedly recommended in budget-brand roundups.[9][17][20]\n- **Pepe Jeans** — strong choice if you want a more stylish fit and can catch discounts.[3][13]\n- **Numero Uno** — good budget-friendly branded option with a dedicated under-₹2000 collection.[3][5]\n- **Spykar** — often available near this range on discount and considered a solid value pick.[3][13]\n- **Levi’s** — best-known brand, but usually above ₹2000 unless discounted.[2][3][12]\n\nIf you want a simple answer: **buy Wrangler first**, and choose **Levi’s only if you find a discounted pair under ₹2000**.[3][9][20]",
